Port of _patches/typescript/018-ls-autoimport-stylepolicy.patch (tsc/internal/ls/autoimport/fix.go) to tsrs.

- Fix.Edits (AddNew): the named or namespace binding uses Fix::namespace_prefix when set, and a set prefix adds the
  usage-site qualifier (add_namespace_qualifier).
- View.GetFixes: every non-empty result goes through View::apply_style_policy; try_add_to_existing_import and the
  AddNew fix record the usage position.
- FixTransformer, autoImportFixTransformerFactory, RegisterAutoImportFixTransformer:
  tsrs_ls::autoimport::{FixTransformer, register_auto_import_fix_transformer} (the factory behind a process-wide
  RwLock, as patch 002's callback; AutoImportFixTransformerFactory names Go's inline func type). FixTransformer is
  `Box<dyn Fn(Option<&Export>, Vec<Arc<Fix>>) -> Vec<Arc<Fix>> + Send + Sync>`: Go's `[]*Fix` is `Vec<Arc<Fix>>`
  (empty for nil).
- The aliasresolver.go hunk (IsSourceFileFromExternalLibrary) is in patch 002, which needs it first.
- View.fixTransformer and the factory call in NewView are patch 027.

